useEffect(() => {
  fetchUser(userId).then(data => setUser(data));
}, [userId]);

[DIALOGUE] Race condition and no cleanup. Two overlapping requests, last one wins — but not necessarily the right one. Also no abort on unmount. Standard async useEffect malpractice.

